cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this repository, please cite the accompanying paper and the PyPSA-Earth software it is derived from."
title: "DRC Myopic PyPSA-Earth Energy System Model"
abstract: "A PyPSA-Earth based constrained energy system model for the Democratic Republic of the Congo, configured for sequential myopic planning horizons and hydrogen export from hydropower under real-world network and resource conditions."
type: software
license: AGPL-3.0-or-later
